<title>UK: Japanese stocks in London static, Tokyo shut.</title>
<headline>Japanese stocks in London static, Tokyo shut.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese shares were little changed in London due to the closure of the Tokyo share market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;We haven't traded a single share this morning,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;The market is open until midday but I wouldn't expect any business,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>The Tokyo bourse was closed on Monday for a national holiday but will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
